- Finalize supplier agreements with TechFlow Industries and PrecisionParts Manufacturing
- Submit regulatory filings for certification by 2025-02-25
- Conduct customer workshops with Pacific Rim Airlines and Neo-City Development Authority

**Short-term Milestones (Next 90 days):**
