### Conclusion and Recommendations

The digital transformation and data analytics initiative represents a strategic priority for Manus Orion Group with significant revenue and market share implications. Successful execution requires continued executive sponsorship from Admiral Michael Torres, disciplined program management, and cross-functional collaboration.

